  SNYK-JAVA-IOMICROMETER-19233327:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          Fix needs Micrometer 1.16.7 or later, which removes io.micrometer.prometheus and breaks the internal Freshworks metrics-util jar. Needs that jar rebuilt first. (io.micrometer:micrometer-core 1.15.12, CRLF Injection)
